WEBVTT

00:04:29.765 --> 00:04:33.936
ÖT: Day was well planned, a quick wedding.

00:04:33.936 --> 00:04:36.939
And thereafter we went back
to the laboratory

00:04:36.939 --> 00:04:42.194
and our guests at our wedding,
that was basically our team,

00:04:42.236 --> 00:04:44.113
our research team.

00:04:44.697 --> 00:04:46.407
So no time to lose, Chris.

00:04:46.407 --> 00:04:47.950
CA: (Laughs)

00:04:47.992 --> 00:04:49.744
That was a pretty special honeymoon.

00:04:49.744 --> 00:04:52.538
I mean, it seems like
your love for each other

00:04:52.538 --> 00:04:55.249
is very much bound up
in your love for this work

00:04:55.249 --> 00:04:57.960
and your sense of
the importance of this work.

00:04:58.002 --> 00:05:02.757
How would you characterize
those intersecting relationships there?